{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/Banner1.png?t=1749373221\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u201cWould you follow the voice of a doll... into a cursed castle that doesn\u2019t want you to leave?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The whispers began the moment you opened the door. You awaken inside <strong>Kurogane Castle</strong>, a place sealed in darkness and silence for over 300 years. A ghostly doll calls you by name how does it know who you are? Why are the spirits drawn to <i>you</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The castle hides forgotten rituals, haunted puzzles, and a past soaked in betrayal and blood. Each room is a mystery. Each door is a test. And something ancient watches your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this isn't just a game. It's a question: \ud83d\udc49 <strong>Can you break the curse... or will you become part of the legend?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/Speed.gif?t=1749373221\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY &amp; PUZZLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Whispers of Kurogane Castle</i>, you\u2019re not just solving puzzles. You\u2019re <strong>unraveling a ghost story</strong> buried beneath centuries of silence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow a mysterious doll that seems to know your past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore haunted chambers inspired by real Japanese folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every puzzle you solve reveals a new piece of the curse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware: fail too many times, and the spirits grow stronger\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What really happened in Kurogane Castle? Why are the spirits so angry? The answers lie beyond puzzles only <strong>the brave and the curious</strong> can solve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/Banner.png?t=1749373221\" /></div>KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Mind-bending puzzles</strong> that blend logic, memory, symbols, and spirit energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf8e <strong>Doll-guided exploration</strong> \u2014 she speaks to you\u2026 but can she be trusted?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfef <strong>Authentic Japanese environments</strong>, inspired by Edo-period history and legend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude31 <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong>, tension, whispers, and surprises around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Rich narrative</strong> that rewards players who read, observe, and dig deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Playable in 10 languages</strong> with full localization.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Failure has consequences</strong> \u2014 the spirits remember everything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/Doll_banner.png?t=1749373221\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to know the truth behind the whispers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now</strong> so you\u2019re the first to step into Kurogane Castle and uncover the secrets the spirits died protecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The doll is waiting.<br>And she knows\u2026 you\u2019re coming.<strong> </strong><br>  <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/im